{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>由MakerVille出品、銀河映像製作的原創劇《地獄大狀》現正熱播，曾於《COURT!》飾演「私影妹」X 小姐的葉澍欣（阿澍）於《地獄大狀》飾演高年級女生，她表示今次是「清純學生擔當」。</p><figure><img alt=\"葉澍欣（阿澍）曾於《COURT!》飾演「私影妹」X 小姐。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186392094647259136436781.jpeg/ijsP5UILN87NCik9kK_DKpSacmIx4SfUR9vw-kfb8Po\"/><figcaption>葉澍欣（阿澍）曾於《COURT!》飾演「私影妹」X 小姐。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"葉澍欣於《地獄大狀》飾演高年級女生。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186392085469597696659301.jpeg/7PEsqoxbChxfZsd9VmProoF2-AOXBmsjd3Cib3dwom8\"/><figcaption>葉澍欣於《地獄大狀》飾演高年級女生。</figcaption></figure><p>阿澍指今次拍攝既興奮又有新鮮感，皆因第一次於拍攝現場看見武術指導，並說：「好想試吓拍動作片，好想有型！」她又謂：「係時候打開電視，《地獄大狀》，逢星期一至五 21:30-22:30。一睇就知今次係清純學生擔當。」她特別感謝劇集監製朱淑儀及導演黃偉傑給予演出機會。</p><figure><img alt=\"阿澍指今次拍攝既興奮又有新鮮感。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186392090146508800390576.jpeg/vHFVlyJtzqzLoUjJSxVDSux3nZQJ6A5bshcL1bIXC9U\"/><figcaption>阿澍指今次拍攝既興奮又有新鮮感。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"第一次於拍攝現場看見武術指導。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186392092369620992269854.jpeg/SzTSVAR4QQo53Xck-EbBaJjJYj4aAxZi_JqBePyagXg\"/><figcaption>第一次於拍攝現場看見武術指導。</figcaption></figure><p>近期有新嘗試的阿澍透露：「第一次喺異地排練多個月，排緊中英劇團音樂劇《邊城》，準備喺松山湖展演中心預演，係新奇嘅體驗。」</p><figure><img alt=\"葉澍欣。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186392092294123520548362.jpeg/PAXodl4zu8-sepK9N6pCl1_w2LGwf-lS13vsx9d77Mc\"/><figcaption>葉澍欣。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"葉澍欣近期有新嘗試。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186392090159091712861209.jpeg/wfcqSyk3tXaqMZqjCvJDN9_4MQjCLEnlhIYVBoSGFQY\"/><figcaption>葉澍欣近期有新嘗試。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"葉澍欣排緊中英劇團音樂劇《邊城》。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186392087906619392064731.jpeg/Yhyzr6VuuJP3r8-ejquaNlQhC-3HLuazvmylG75spRs\"/><figcaption>葉澍欣排緊中英劇團音樂劇《邊城》。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"葉澍欣間中也會發放福利照。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186392085691895808315948.jpeg/sp56VI0yCx9SgW4LRiog-yTcHd3_yPkUuvECMLrxAjA\"/><figcaption>葉澍欣間中也會發放福利照。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《地獄大狀》學生妹\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186392087793373184592870.jpeg/sPJb2TMwNTRXHEdKuF52_HgOtZOUEmkTO0IpsDtCKbA\"/><figcaption>《地獄大狀》學生妹</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T16:00:21.209941+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":427,"images":9,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T15:45:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T18:57:48.956190+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T15:57:45.925560+00:00","content_hash":"5d4bfd9f712b0fc35092b3d44026576acd172fa2efd85be9b2328d7957936045","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}